{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-028",
    "title": "：一纸封天令"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_149",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "“谁决定最小？”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "石室门环在顾长离手中微微发热。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4821,
          "end": 4821
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她没有立即推门，先把铜针插进门缝。针尖触到某种坚硬的东西，发出一声细响。门内念名单的声音已经停止，只有火焰燃烧的噼啪声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4823,
          "end": 4823
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“有人在里面。”陆照临说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4825,
          "end": 4825
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“也可能是记录。”顾长离回答。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4827,
          "end": 4827
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她推开门。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4829,
          "end": 4829
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "石室中央摆着一张圆桌，桌上放着一面无相铜镜。镜面朝下，周围点着七支白蜡。蜡火没有影子，照得石壁一片惨白。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4831,
          "end": 4831
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻坐在圆桌另一侧。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4833,
          "end": 4833
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你怎么进来的？”叶观澜不在，他的位置空着。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4835,
          "end": 4835
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“暗道本来就是无相寺修的。”慧闻说，“只是后来被三方共同封闭。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4837,
          "end": 4837
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离走到桌边：“你在念谁的名字？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4839,
          "end": 4839
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“被删去的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4841,
          "end": 4841
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“有我叔父吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4843,
          "end": 4843
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“有。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4845,
          "end": 4845
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆沉舟呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4847,
          "end": 4847
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻抬手，将无相铜镜翻过来。镜面没有倒影，只有一圈缓慢旋转的灰雾。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4849,
          "end": 4849
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他不在名单里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4851,
          "end": 4851
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临皱眉：“他不是被删去的人？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4853,
          "end": 4853
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“盟约还没结束。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4879,
          "end": 4879
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻看向三人：“谁先照镜？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4881,
          "end": 4881
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临伸手：“我。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4883,
          "end": 4883
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他把无相铜镜立在面前。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4885,
          "end": 4885
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "镜面灰雾散开，出现一间北河城的旧屋。年幼的陆照临坐在床边，陆沉舟将一盏空灯放在他膝上。屋外有人争吵，声音断断续续，只能听见“太虚”“封存”“不能留下”几个词。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4887,
          "end": 4887
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆沉舟蹲在他面前：“如果我不回来，你就去玄霄宗。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4889,
          "end": 4889
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“为什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4891,
          "end": 4891
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为那里有人记得我。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4893,
          "end": 4893
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4895,
          "end": 4895
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆沉舟没有回答。他将灰白石片按进陆照临胸口，石片化作青光，融入心脉。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4897,
          "end": 4897
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "年幼的陆照临疼得哭出声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4899,
          "end": 4899
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋站在门外，手里提着第三盏灯。她没有进屋，只把灯放在门槛上。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4901,
          "end": 4901
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "镜面忽然裂开。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4903,
          "end": 4903
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临退后一步，胸口剧痛。一个陌生名字从他舌尖滑出：“沈砚秋。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4905,
          "end": 4905
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你看见了什么？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4907,
          "end": 4907
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“她在我父亲离开前见过他。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4909,
          "end": 4909
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“还有呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4911,
          "end": 4911
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我不知道。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4913,
          "end": 4913
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻把镜面转向顾长离：“轮到你。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4915,
          "end": 4915
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离咬牙坐下。镜中先出现一座顾氏祠堂，年轻的顾长离站在门外，听见族老宣读债契。她的叔父跪在堂中，面前放着第二盏灯。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4917,
          "end": 4917
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "族老说：“顾氏欠灵脉一盏灯，欠玄霄宗三名经手人，欠后代一条命。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4919,
          "end": 4919
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叔父抬头：“账不能这样记。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4921,
          "end": 4921
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "族老把铜环按在他额头：“那就把你的名字记进去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4923,
          "end": 4923
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叔父抢走第二盏灯，冲出祠堂。年幼的顾长离追到门口，看见他回头。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4925,
          "end": 4925
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“别跟来。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4927,
          "end": 4927
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "镜中顾长离没有停下。她追着叔父跑到雪地，直到一扇青铜门前。门内伸出无脸的手，将叔父的脸从影子里抹去。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4929,
          "end": 4929
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离猛地睁眼，额头全是冷汗。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4931,
          "end": 4931
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他不是被选中的。”她说，“他是自己替别人进去的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4933,
          "end": 4933
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻点头：“所以债契落到你身上。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4935,
          "end": 4935
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我可以把债还回去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4937,
          "end": 4937
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你要把谁的名字还回去？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4939,
          "end": 4939
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离没有回答。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4941,
          "end": 4941
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜拿起无相铜镜：“我来。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4943,
          "end": 4943
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "镜中出现归墟盟旧坛。三百年前，归墟盟盟主将一张写满名字的纸递给玄霄宗修士。纸上第一行是“陆沉舟”，第二行是一个被墨涂黑的叶姓，第三行是顾氏旧印。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4945,
          "end": 4945
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "盟主说：“只要抹去这些名字，城心就会沉睡。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4947,
          "end": 4947
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "年轻的归墟盟弟子站在旁边，手里握着刀。他没有参与撕纸，而是将其中一半藏进袖中。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-065",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4949,
          "end": 4949
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "那张脸与叶观澜相似，却显得更年轻。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-066",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4951,
          "end": 4951
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜伸手按住镜面：“够了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-067",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4953,
          "end": 4953
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你看见了自己的祖辈。”陆照临说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-068",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 4955,
          "end": 4955
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-092",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5003,
          "end": 5003
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“共同阻止天门开启。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5069,
          "end": 5069
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向石板底部：“代价写在哪里？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5071,
          "end": 5071
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士沉默。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5073,
          "end": 5073
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻转动铜镜。镜中浮出一座灵脉城的影像。城中仍有灯火，屋顶有人走动，孩童在街边堆雪。城心却有一道青色裂缝，正慢慢向城墙延伸。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5075,
          "end": 5075
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“封天令会把异动锁在这座城。”慧闻说，“城里的人会成为锚。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5077,
          "end": 5077
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他们会怎样？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5079,
          "end": 5079
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“灵脉平息，他们失去部分记忆。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5081,
          "end": 5081
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“如果灵脉不平息？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5083,
          "end": 5083
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“城会先塌。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5085,
          "end": 5085
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离盯着镜中孩童：“你们要拿活人封门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5087,
          "end": 5087
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士说：“这是最小的代价。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5089,
          "end": 5089
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁决定最小？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5091,
          "end": 5091
        }
      }
    ],
